It is not as with the Ident Identity Isle which must be valid without exception.
People who no longer wanted to drive should hand over their driving licences.
Simply bring it or send it to the corresponding municipality.
Driving permits issued between 1964 and 1993 will no longer be valid at the end of the year.
However, vehicle drivers are also forced to progressively renew other types of driving licences.
