Will there be an end-of-year rally on the stock market?
Less less than five weeks from the end of the year, investors are already waning their hands hoping for the arrival of the traditional year-end rally.
However, this year the experts aren't as confident that that's going to happen.
Banif believes that "from a statistical point of view, the month of December on the stock exchange generally has a positive behavior.
However, forecasts should not be made exclusively based on statistics, given the current context, uncertainties lingering in, at least in short-term markets ".
