Congress approves the transposition of Mifi, which came into force on 1 November
Parallel to its parliamentary formality, which came to an end today with the congressional vote of the amendments incorporated into the draft in the Senate, the Government has submitted to a public hearing the regulations which will develop the new law, with the objective of its entry into force before the year expires.
Representations from different groups agreed to highlight the effort made by deputies and senators to negotiate and make the best regulations to ensure investor protection and to regulate in detail the activity of the organizations in order for markets to function effectively.
The Mifi, which modifies the Securities Market Act, involves the modernisation of financial markets, at a time when it strengthens the protection of the investor, improves the powers of the directors of the National Securities Market Commission (CNMV) and promotes cooperation between the various leaders of the European Union.
The new regulation will provide financial advisory services for both specialised social reasons and natural or legal persons and create a new type of financial services (ESIS), financial consulting companies (FIAs), which merge with securities companies, securities agencies and portfolio management companies.
In addition, it is increasing the number of systems for the implementation of transactions on financial instruments, so that it is possible to add multilateral trading systems and order internationalization systems, competing with the current stock-extinguishing managers.
The Act also obliges investment services companies to disclose on the market information on the key aspects of its business profile, risk-exhibitability and forms of risk-manage and requires them to keep a register of all the transactions they carry out, in order to facilitate oversight by CNMV.
Through the Congressional Economics Commission, several changes have been added, one of which points out that outstanding debts will be regarded as "compluted" financial instrument given its high risk to the investor, which has been demonstrated with what has happened with the debt of high-risk US mortgages (sub-prim).
In addition, they have taken advantage of the transposition of the management took the opportunity to demarcelebate legally the functions that economic graduates may have 30 years after, in 1977, the Royal Decree demarcating the professional functions reserved for economists.
For its part, the Senate has incorporated the creation of new figures in the financial sector, such as the ombudswoman, which will work on behalf of a company, which will not require the authorization of CNMV and which will be able to lend its product marketing services and attracting new clients at the same time.
Harmonised consumer price index rises by five tenths in November, up to 4.1%
This indicator, which is subsequently used by Eurostat to include it in calculating the inflation rate in the European Union, provides an overview of the development of prices in Spain during the month of November.
Its publication complies with the policy of Eurostat and the European Central Bank (ECB) by offering data comparable in time and quality to those produced in the United States.
Deadfinite indicator is calculated using the same process used for the Harmonised Consumption Price Index, but using various statistical modelling methods to estimate the information on which no publication is yet available.
INE pointed out that the information provided by the leading indicator was only indicative, because it did not necessarily have to coincide with the final data that would be revealed on 14 December.
"CSI will continue at relatively high levels"
The Second Vice-President and the Minister of the Economy, Pedro Solbes, stated that the 4.1 per cent increase in the CPI in the month of November is a "temporal figure", but at the same time he has predicted that the price index will continue on "relatively tall" levels in the coming months.
In any case Solbes specified in the congressional corridors that "though the numerality is not good", Spain's inflation differential about monetary union continues to be "more or less" the same as in recent in recent years.
He also explained that in November “there was less surprise” than during the previous month, when the Government was not facing such a large increase.
'We were hoping for a figure of around 4%,' said the Minister for the Economy in relation to the data announced today.
Virin plans to recover with Northern Rock EUR 42 000 million over three years
