The Balkan Public Prosecutor
Carla del Ponte for the past eight years relentlessly pursues Balkan war criminals from the Public Prosecutor's Office of the Criminal Justice for the Former Yugoslavia in The The Hague.
Its mandate ends at the end of the year, and Carla will leave with a bitter taste, because those most responsible for the killing of Srebrenica - in which 8,800 Bosnian Muslims have died, ex-General Ratko Mladic and ex-Leader serbobosnio Radovan Karazic are still at liberty.
Their names are in this list whose documentary filmmaker Marcel Schapbach takes its title, 'the list of Carla' (2006, not shown exclusively in Spain), with the rhythm of a police thriller, which follows the work of the Swiss prosecutor from Belgrade in New York who is chasing the fugitive criminals and lobbies the governments involved to shatter the circle.
What assurance is right for me?
Motor insurance, which covers the driver in the face of possible claims, involves a significant expense which will depend on various factors, such as the age, sex, seniority of the driving licence, the civil status, the type of vehicle to insecure or the use made, inter alia.
Having a car is the main one.
Escoger el seguro de autom-vil adecuado es includeo m-s dif-cil que elegir el modelo de veh-culo.
And it's because choosing the right car insurance is even more difficult than choosing the vehicle model.
Car insurance is an agreement between an insurance company and the insurer.
This compromise materializes by an insurance contract, which establishes that the company receives the value of the premium granted and in exchange it becomes responsible for the obligation to pay compensation in the event of a claim.
Premium is the insurance price, which takes into account various factors, such as the age, sex, seniority of the driving licence, the civil registry, the type of vehicle to be insecure or its use, among others.
Insurance companies set their prices according to the statistics, so that the higher the probability of an accident, the higher the rating.
It is for this reason that persons over the age of 25 and women have to pay lower premiums, since the statistics show that these people have a lower rate of claims due to prudence.
In the same way, using censuses, companies have concluded that Married persons tend to have fewer accidents than single drivers.
The use made of the vehicle will have an impact on the frequency, and therefore on the probability of having an accident.
By increasing the frequency probabilities increase.
Many of the variables that insurers take into account when determining the premium price.
It is for this reason that the driver must carefully study the situation in order to choose the motor insurance that is best suited to his profile.
We will explain here the most significant variables when choosing one or the other type of insurance, so that it, in addition to adapting to the characteristics of the insurer, offers it a reasonable price.
Juveniles under the age of 25 face a variety of drawbacks when placing an insurance contract at an accessible price, such as low experience in the conduct and seniority of a driving licence.
Although the ideal way to be properly insured is insurance at any risk, there are other more cost-effective options available.
Drivers most far-sighted can opt for risk insurance with deductible, in such a way that they obtain insurance coverage at any risk but at a more accessible price.
This form of agreement implies that the customer pays part of the amount of the claim.
'The part of the amount of the claim that the customer pays will be determined on the basis of the value of the premium, which will be higher, the lower the amount,' says Luis Noguera, the manager in Spain of First Europa, an on-line insurance ombudsman.
Another option is third-by-third-party insurance, in such a way that the Customer provides protection to deal with damage caused to third-party damage caused by third-party damage.
In addition, it would cover against the theft, fires and the loss of the vehicle.
One piece of advice.
If you are a 25-year-woulder try to be careful and avoid claims as far as possible, since this will have an impact on subsidisation, which may reduce the price of insurance in the future.
A subsidy is a reduction in the base fare that the company owns.
On the other hand, a sanction is an increase in the basic tariff.
'The bonuses and the penalties will depend on the company and its profits.
If the company has had a good new year, it will be able to afford to increase the bonuses", clarifies Noguera.
Beyond the age of 25, this becomes easier for drivers to enter into an insurance contract, since the claim rate is reduced thanks to the accumulated experience.
It is for this reason that it is preferable to choose any risk insurance with deductible.
'Nully young people cannot take advantage of previous experience after an accident, assures the director of the European company in Spain and adds that the majority of accidents occur during the second year of driving, once the 'fear of the novice'.
However, if the client is married but does not yet have children, it is preferable for him to negotiate insurance at any risk, as long as its economic situation allows it.
Marriages with children are regarded by insurers as persons with the lowest sinister rate, because mark-ups will be lower.
In this case, the best insurance would be insurance at any risk with deductible (which may amount to EUR 300), or third-party self-insurance extended as from the third year of life of the vehicle when the insured person has a high level of rebate.
'They have more casual conduct and they have greater purchasing power to afford the luxurious to assume a larger quantity of franchises,' Luis Noguera said.
For retirees, debilitated risk insurance is preferable (i.e. EUR 150), or third-party insurance extended when the insurer has a high level of rebate.
It has to be said that car insurance is something important, not only because it covers the driver in the face of possible disasters, but also because it represents an important expense, which is why it is essential to properly study the insurance that suits us best according to our personal circumstances.
